/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   STEP 6 : PAYROLL CUSTOMERS - FACILITY VIEW
   Purpose : Find which facilities that pay their staff through BSI payroll are already BSI customers:
             first by exact name, then by name similarity (score > 0.9).
